SilentProbe: Measuring Silent Failure in Production APIs Used as
Agent Tools
Zongrong Li
Department of Geography, Texas A&M University
College Station, Texas, USA
Monid, Inc.
San Francisco, California, USA
zongrong@tamu.edu
Shengkun Ye∗
Monid, Inc.
San Francisco, California, USA
shengkun@monid.ai
Feiyou Guo∗
