Coverage asymmetry. The agent experiments cover three ven-
dors against 27 for the measurement campaign. The two halves
have complementary rather than equal coverage. Model access is
via one gateway rather than each vendor’s native API, which could
in principle alter request handling.
Vocabulary recovery is brute force, so every reported vocab-
